(7698226, 1262827, 173844, '<td valign="top">The moon''s odd but I like it, a benevolent aunt.  The sky, in all its grain, is handsomely alive for all its fraudulent dreariness.  The delicate trees dance with subdued allure.  Very moving.<br/>Gotta pack this in with my two co-favorites as a third.</td>', 'The moon''s odd but I like it, a benevolent aunt.  The sky, in all its grain, is handsomely alive for all its fraudulent dreariness.  The delicate trees dance with subdued allure.  Very moving.Gotta pack this in with my two co-favorites as a third.', '2021-07-30 00:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
